0","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select","content":"Select is a dropdown for picking one or more values from a list of options. It renders a labeled trigger and a popover listbox, supports single and multiple selection, and submits naturally inside a form."},"1332":{"id":"/docs/components/select-1","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"Features"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/components/select-2","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#installation","content":"Installation"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/components/select-3","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"Examples"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/components/select-4","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#props","content":"Props"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/components/select-5","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#select","content":"Select"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/components/select-6","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectoptions","content":"SelectOptions"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/components/select-7","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectvalue","content":"SelectValue"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/components/select-8","page_id":"/docs/components/select","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/select#selectitem","content":"SelectItem"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/components/select-9","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/components/select-10","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/components/select-11","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/components/select-12","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/components/select-13","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/components/select-14","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/components/select-15","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/components/select-16","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/components/select-17","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#features","content":"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/components/select-18","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-d"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/components/select-19","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/components/select-20","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/components/select-21","page_id":"/docs/components/select","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/select#examples","content":"import { ArgTypes, Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/run"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","type":"page","content":"SizeProvider","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/size-provider"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-0","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider","content":"Sizes a section, so the text, controls, and default spacing inside it follow one size."},"1355":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-1","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"Features"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-2","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/size-provider#examples","content":"Examples"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-3","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/size-provider#props","content":"Props"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-4","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"`sm`, `md`, or `lg` for the adopted components inside (listed below): their text, controls, and\ndefault spacing."},"1359":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-5","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"The nearest scope wins, and nested scopes replace the size rather than compounding it."},"1360":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-6","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"A component's own `size` prop wins for that component only."},"1361":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-7","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"Overlays opened inside, such as Modal and Select options, open at the scope's size even though\nthey render in a portal."},"1362":{"id":"/docs/components/size-provider-8","page_id":"/docs/components/size-provider","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/size-provider#features","content":"Renders no element, so it never affects layout. Only Antares components follow it; plain HTML\nkeeps its own typography, so put 