 - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[706,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[714,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[715,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[713,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1590,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1163,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[695,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[222,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[699,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1416,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1554,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1588,"**An explicit prop on a child always wins** over what the lockup supplies. Pass\n`<Tag slot=\"eyebrow\" size=\"sm\">` to break the pairing, for instance."],[1196,"**Arrow Down/Right**: Move to next radio button"],[1318,"**Arrow Left/Right**: Move to next/previous segment"],[1197,"**Arrow Up/Left**: Move to previous radio button"],[237,"**Auto-sizing**: Uses VisX's `useParentSize` hook to adapt to container width"],[692,"