mes horizontally scrollable"],[860,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[851,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[722,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[762,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[218,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[382,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[381,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[241,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[924,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1667,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[274,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[758,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[236,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[964,"**Menu accessible name**: Set `aria-label` on the `<Menu>` to name the list (e.g., \"Actions\", \"Share with\"). This is separate from any `Heading` title in the popover."],[969,"**Menu name**: Set `aria-label` on `<Menu>` to name the list (\"Actions\", \"Share with\", \"Theme\")."],[948,"**Menu title and groups**: Place an optional `Heading` as a sibling to `Menu` (not `slot=\"title\"`). Use `MenuGroup` + `Header` + `Heading` for section labels; group headings are presentational."],[775,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[240,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[974,"**Mobile**: Replace `MenuTrigger` + `Popover` with `Drawer` on narrow viewports; reuse the same `Menu`."],[1557,"**Multiline**: Compose a `TextArea` instead of an `Input` for multiline entry"],[769,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1162,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[691,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[756,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[952,"**Popover or drawer**: Open from `MenuTrigger` for positioned overlays, or place `Menu` in a `Drawer` for full-screen/mobile."],[773,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[766,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1193,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1192,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[926,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1348,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[880,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[757,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[752,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[216,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[247,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1669,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contex