he circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[850,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[867,"`BoxContext` supplies default props to Boxes in its subtree. A `slots` map supplies defaults to\nnamed parts; each Box selects one with `slot`. Explicit consumer props override defaults, while\nclasses, styles, and refs are merged. Pass `slot={null}` to opt out of the context."],[513,"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."],[153,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[184,"`CardGroup` uses grid navigation: Tab enters or leaves, arrow keys move between Cards, and Space\nchanges selection. Enter activates row actions or links. Choose selection or `onAction`;\ncombining them prevents pointer selection."],[374,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[435,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[447,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[431,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[440,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot